sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HR as HR system
    participant API as Ingestion service
    participant APPLY as Transactional applier
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant PUB as Outbox publisher
    HR->>API: POST /hr/events (1-1000 records)
    loop Each record independently
        API->>API: Ownership filter, normalize, validate
        alt Invalid record
            API->>DB: Code-only rejection in separate transaction
        else Valid record - newer-version write path shown
            API->>APPLY: apply() through separate bean
            APPLY->>DB: BEGIN, reserve unique receipt key
            APPLY->>DB: Lock employee, compare version and hash
            alt Business fields changed
                APPLY->>DB: Employee + final receipt + one outbox row
            else Higher version, identical state
                APPLY->>DB: Version/timestamp + NO_CHANGE receipt, no outbox
            end
            APPLY->>DB: COMMIT
        end
    end
    API-->>HR: HTTP 200 with per-record outcomes
    Note over API,DB: Connection outage: stop with 503, earlier record commits remain
    PUB->>DB: Claim due row FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    PUB->>PUB: Deliver to sinks with bounded timeout
    PUB->>DB: Mark PUBLISHED and commit
    Note over DB,PUB: Independent publisher can run before the HTTP response finishes. Delivery may repeat.
